Subject: [PATCH 6.1 129/885] wifi: ipw2200: fix memory leak in ipw_wdev_init()
Date: Tue,  7 Mar 2023 17:51:03 +0100
Message-Id: <20230307170007.443267115@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.39.2
